    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose īkī tūkalemeelwa ū kwiyūmīlīja, tūkabona īlī hambū hambū nūūlū kūlekwa iyene ī Atene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene tūkantūma ū ndūgū wise ū Timotheo, ūyo alī ntūmami wa ng'wa Mulungu kūlwa Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Kilisito, ize ko amujaamye na kūmulūngūja ū mu kūzunya kwing'we; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atizigela nūūlū ūmò wing'we wa kūtala kūlwa būluhiwa wenūbū. Nguno a bing'we benekīlī mumanile hape gīkī shitwigeleelilwe kūluhiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo tūkamuwīla kūfuma haho wandījo aho twalī ning'we, gīkī tūlī hihī kwingīla mu būluhiwa; na ng'hana īkaja chene gīt'ūmo mumanīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū nene īkī nakaduuma ū kwiyūmīlīja, nakabona natūme munhū, namane ūmo mulījīla ū mu kūzunya kwing'we; atizūbiza wamugemile ū ngemi, gūbize gwachile mpandagīlo ū nīmo gwise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha ū Timotheo wamalile kūshoka kūfuma ū kū bing'we, ī ng'hūlū ja būzunya nū būtogwa wing'we ījo watwenhelile jilī jawiza no, nīyo ūtūwīla nū gwa gīkī būlī gwa mukūtwizūkagwa; na hangī mulī na ng'hūmbū ja kūtūbona gīt'ūmo na a bise tūlī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmubona a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose badūgū, aho twajiigwa ī mhola ja kūzunya kwing'we twalūngūjiwe no ū mu būpīna wise, na a makoye ayo gakatūgwīla kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ī haha hū tūlī bapanga, ūlū ng'ūhandatīla kwīmīīla ū mulī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno hīmba tūkūnūmba na kalūmbīle kī ū Mulungu wise, ū mu būyegi ūbo tūlī nabo kū būtongi bokwe kūlwa nguno ying'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līīmi na būjikū tūkūlombaga na būjangīīzu būtaale gīkī tūmubone ū būshū wing'we, tūmugoloolele īyo īligoma goma ū mu kūzunya kwing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū ī haha ū Mulungu Sīswe ng'wenekīlī, nū Yesu Seeba wise, leka atūtonge ī nzīla ya kwiza ūko mulī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we, ū Seeba ang'winhe kūbiza na būtogwa wingī bo kūseesekela na kūseesekela, ng'witogwe a bing'we benekīlī, pye na a banhū a bangī, gīt'ūmo tūkwītīlaga a bise ū kū bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amushikanye ū mung'holò jing'we, ū ng'wikanza lya kwiza kwa ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu hamò na beela bakwe bose, musangwe mulī beela mutī na shilingo ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu Sīswe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
